# Title & Task Force
lines.append("# 2026 ESC Guidelines for the management of heart failure")
lines.append("")
lines.append("##### Developed by the task force for the management of heart failure of the European Society of Cardiology (ESC). With the special contribution of the Heart Failure Association (HFA) of the ESC. Endorsed by the European Association for Cardio-Thoracic Surgery (EACTS).")
lines.append("")
lines.append("##### Authors/Task Force Members: Lars Køber (Chairperson) (Denmark), Marianna Adamo (Chairperson) (Italy), Anne-Christine Ruwald (Task Force Co-ordinator) (Denmark), Daniela Tomasoni (Task Force Co-ordinator) (Italy), Lisa J. Anderson (United Kingdom), Stefan D. Anker (Germany), Michael Böhm (Germany), Jelena Čelutkienė (Lithuania), Ovidiu Chioncel (Romania), Alain Cohen-Solal (France), Maria Crespo-Leiro (Spain), Gerasimos Filippatos (Greece), Loreena Hill (United Kingdom), Arno Hoes (Netherlands), Ewa A. Jankowska (Poland), Mitja Lainscak (Slovenia), Carolyn S.P. Lam (Singapore), Mamas A. Mamas (United Kingdom), Theresa McDonagh (United Kingdom), Marco Metra (Italy), Brenda Moura (Portugal), Wilfried Mullens (Belgium), Petar Seferovic (Serbia), Frank Ruschitzka (Switzerland), Gianluigi Savarese (Sweden), Thomas Thum (Germany), Dirk van Veldhuisen (Netherlands), Stephan von Haehling (Germany), and ESC Scientific Document Group.")
