# Classes of Recommendations & Levels of Evidence
lines.append('<details class="med-details"><summary>')
lines.append("")
lines.append('### Table 1, 2 & 3. Classes of Recommendations and Levels of Evidence</summary><div class="details-content">')
lines.append("")
lines.append("#### Table 1: Classes of Recommendations")
lines.append("| Class of Recommendation | Definition | Suggested Wording to Use |")
lines.append("|---|---|---|")
lines.append("| **Class I** | Evidence and/or general agreement that a given treatment or procedure is beneficial, useful, effective. | **Is recommended** or **is indicated** |")
lines.append("| **Class II** | Conflicting evidence and/or a divergence of opinion about the usefulness/efficacy of the given treatment or procedure. | |")
lines.append("| — **Class IIa** | Weight of evidence/opinion is in favour of usefulness/efficacy. | **Should be considered** |")
lines.append("| — **Class IIb** | Usefulness/efficacy is less well established by evidence/opinion. | **May be considered** |")
lines.append("| **Class III** | Evidence or general agreement that the given treatment or procedure is not useful/effective, and in some cases may be harmful. | **Is not recommended** |")
lines.append("")
lines.append("#### Table 2: Levels of Evidence — Therapy and Prevention")
lines.append("| Level of Evidence | Definition |")
lines.append("|---|---|")
lines.append("| **Level A** | Data derived from multiple randomized clinical trials or meta-analyses. |")
lines.append("| **Level B1** | Data derived from a single randomized clinical trial or large non-randomized studies. |")
lines.append("| **Level B2** | Data derived from subgroup analyses of randomized clinical trials or registries. |")
lines.append("| **Level C** | Consensus of opinion of the experts and/or small studies, retrospective studies, registries. |")
lines.append("")
lines.append("#### Table 3: Levels of Evidence — Diagnostic Tests and Prediction Models")
lines.append("| Level of Evidence | Definition |")
lines.append("|---|---|")
lines.append("| **Level A** | High-quality diagnostic test accuracy studies or externally validated risk models. |")
lines.append("| **Level B** | Moderate-quality diagnostic studies or internally validated prediction models. |")
lines.append("| **Level C** | Expert consensus or exploratory diagnostic evaluations. |")
lines.append("")
lines.append("</div></details>")
