# Section 1: Preamble
lines.append('<details class="med-details"><summary>')
lines.append("")
lines.append('## 1. Preamble</summary><div class="details-content">')
lines.append("")
lines.append("Clinical practice guidelines summarize and evaluate all available evidence on a particular issue at the time of the writing process, with the overarching aim of assisting healthcare professionals in selecting the best management strategies for an individual patient suffering from a given condition.")
lines.append("")
lines.append("These 2026 Guidelines on the management of Heart Failure were developed by an interdisciplinary Task Force appointed by the European Society of Cardiology (ESC), with direct contribution from the Heart Failure Association (HFA) of the ESC, and endorsed by the European Association for Cardio-Thoracic Surgery (EACTS).")
lines.append("")
lines.append("The recommendations are grounded on an extensive synthesis of randomized clinical trials, observational cohorts, systematic reviews, and international registry data published up to 2026. Great care has been taken to avoid biases, manage potential conflicts of interest, and formulate concise, practical guidance. The Guideline provides actionable clinical algorithms structured around the patient pathway, ensuring equitable, evidence-based, and multidisciplinary delivery of cardiovascular healthcare.")
